803. Improper Validation of Team Invitation APIs
Team Invitation Authorization Bypass
Attackers send or accept invitations to restricted teams without permission.
💰 Typical payout: $400 – $8,000
804. Insecure Handling of File Processing Queues
File Processing Queue Exploit
Malicious files processed by background workers trigger unintended behavior.
💰 Typical payout: $500 – $9,000
805. Improper Validation of Comment Moderation APIs
Comment Moderation Authorization Bypass
